   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Self-ICE<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances Self-ICE, which then counts as Borgware for Maximum Humanity Loss. The user's Neuroport NET Architecture gains one more floor, which can only hold a Black ICE program (supplied separately).</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corgo's required content includes the Edgerunners Mission Kit and Interface RED, and this parent piece comes from there rather than from Cyberpunk RED - Core, which ships no item for it. Make the parent yourself before installing this into it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
